        "# Conda Package Management And Environments - mod-8\n\n",
        "**Course:** conda-package-management-and-environments\n\n",
        "Run the code cells below to practice.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "# Conda Environment Management\n\n# Create new environment\nconda create -n myproject python=3.11 -y\n\n# Activate environment\nconda activate myproject\n\n# Install packages (prefer conda for scientific packages)\nconda install numpy pandas scikit-learn matplotlib -y\n\n# Install from pip when package not in conda\npip install transformers datasets\n\n# List packages\nconda list\n\n# Export environment (for sharing/reproducibility)\nconda env export > environment.yml\n\n# Create environment from file\nconda env create -f environment.yml\n\n# Remove environment\nconda env remove -n old_project\n\n# List all environments\nconda env list\n\n# Update all packages\nconda update --all"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
